# Contributing

Thanks for your interest in contributing to Prostgles UI.

## Scope

This repository contains:

- Web client
- Server
- Electron desktop app
- End-to-end tests
- Shared TypeScript packages
- Documentation

Please keep changes scoped and focused. Separate refactors from feature work where possible.

## Before You Start

1. Open an issue describing the bug/feature, or confirm an existing issue.
2. Wait for maintainer feedback for larger changes.
3. Fork and create a feature branch from master

## Local Setup

1. Install dependencies:
   - Node.js (LTS)
   - Postgres
   - Docker (recommended for local stack)
2. Start development:
   - npm run dev
3. Run tests before opening a PR:
   - npm test
   - e2e tests if your change affects UI flows

## Coding Standards

- Follow existing linting and formatting rules.
- Keep PRs small and reviewable.
- Avoid unrelated formatting-only changes in feature PRs.
- Update docs when behavior or setup changes.

## Pull Request Checklist

- [ ] Tests added/updated for behavior changes
- [ ] Existing tests pass
- [ ] Docs updated (README/docs/changelog) when needed
- [ ] No sensitive data or credentials committed

## PR Review Expectations

- Maintainers may request changes before merge.
- CI must pass.
- Security-sensitive changes may require additional review time.

## Reporting Security Issues

Please do not open public issues for vulnerabilities.  
Use the private security contact in the repository security policy.
